          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kir'ekyo abakazi mushanju tulikwata omushaija omoi, nibagamba bati, “Turayelisa mara twejweke, kyonkai tube bakazi bawe, iwe otwihyeho ekihemu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kir'ekyo eitagi ly'Omukama liliba lirungi mara libe ly'ekitinwa, n'ebiraba by'ensi biliba kyebugo, mara kitinwa ky'ensigalira za Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu alisigara Sioni n'alisigara Yerusalemu alyetwa mutakatifu, buli omoi ayahandikirwe hamoi n'abarora omuli Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo bilibaho orwo Omukama aliba yamazire kwogya ebihagaro by'abakazi ba Yerusalemu, akagarulira n'entambara y'okwitwa kw'abantu abaitirwe Yerusalemu. Alikoza eiramu n'ekibonabonyio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kir'ekyo, obwire bukeire, alibunza Eibanga lya Sioni lyona n'abantu atulishangwa bateraniire aho, Omukama alibabunza ekichwi, kandi omu kiro ababunze omwika n'omuliro ogulikurabagira; aha rw'okuba ekitinwa kyona ky'Omukama kilishweka ekigo kyona n'okukyemera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obwire bukeire ekitinwakye kilibunda ekigo kitaterwa mushana mara ekigo ekyo kibe buhungiro, tikiliterwa njura anga kuhutwa mbuyaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
